  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.4.2-beta.8`\n\n### Features\n\n- restore local terminal tabs in their last working directory ([5d9e09d4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5d9e09d4d0edea715c4539a95bc6cc30bbbc4570))\n- carry collapsed profile groups in backups ([72d17192](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/72d1719203bc0c100b3849ba669905a46c212fd1))\n- move session, window background and backup/sync settings into the database ([7c4e609d](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/7c4e609d74e94d54eae3067dddcf6ac0b582dac6))\n- move custom themes and app runtime state into the database ([c55c0eca](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c55c0ecab78758d1960f447084ee2c2ed6450ea9))\n- enhance backup and sync features with WebDAV settings, automatic backup management, and improved handling of missing key files ([e90c95fe](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/e90c95fe18e59633e1a3226b61e40a2058103627))\n- update styles for improved UI consistency and add new classes for SFTP drawer functionality ([c9a9bb58](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c9a9bb58cb95da2e195e71e6380d57b736debe57))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.4.2-beta.8...v0.4.2-beta.9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.4.2-beta.8...v0.4.2-beta.9)\n",
